### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### 1. Create room
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

###
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Get room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

### 3. Get a missing room (expected: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 4. Create booking (change the dates to the future!)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Get booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 6. Overlapping booking (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 7. Cancel booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 8. Add your own requests here for the rules in ASSIGNMENT.md

### 9. R1 empty name (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "capacity": 10
}

### 10. R1 capacity 0 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Room X",
  "capacity": 0
}

### 11. R2 bookedBy empty (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "",
  "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-02-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 12. R3 end == start (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 13. R4 attendees 11 > capacity 10 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-02-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 11
}

### 14. R5 start in the past, 2020 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2020-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2020-02-01T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 15. R6 exactly 4 hours (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-01T08:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-01T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 16. R6 4 hours 1 minute (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-03-02T08:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-03-02T12:01:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 17. R7 touching interval, starts when request 4 ends (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "carmen",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 18. Missing room with invalid body (expected: 404, not 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "",
  "startUtc": "2030-02-01T12:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 0
}

### 19. Booking used for the cancel tests (expected: 201)
# Separate from request 4, because request 7 already cancelled that one.
# @name cancelTestBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "dan",
  "startUtc": "2030-04-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-04-01T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@cancelBookingId = {{cancelTestBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 20. Cancel (expected: 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{cancelBookingId}}/cancel

### 21. Cancel again (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{cancelBookingId}}/cancel

### 22. Cancel missing booking (expected: 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel

### 23. Same interval as request 19, after cancel (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "elena",
  "startUtc": "2030-04-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-04-01T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}
